    "900.4.10(90)": {
      "explanation": "Exception RS 90 sets site-specific rules: a 22 m setback from the original street centreline on Birchmount Rd., St. Clair Ave., Danforth Rd. and Kennedy Rd. frontages; a 1.5 m street-side setback; for detached houses a 9.0 m minimum frontage, 278 m2 minimum lot area and 0.45 m side setback; for semi-detached houses a 15.0 m frontage, 483 m2 lot area and 0.9 m side setback for the whole building, or 7.5 m frontage and 240 m2 lot area for each half. No prevailing by-laws apply.",
